!
! This versioned filename is selected only by a compiler that implements
! riscv_simd_math_abi_v1(mask) and the matching RV64/lp64d vector ABI.  The
! mask bits, low to high, are m1 fixed-N, m1 Nx-N, m1 fixed-M, m1 Nx-M,
! m2 fixed-N, m2 Nx-N, m2 fixed-M and m2 Nx-M.  The generator derives each
! function's mask from the exact rows present in mathvec-variants.mk, so a
! partial m1 library is described without advertising absent variants.
! A mathvec-disabled build installs this file with comments only.
@MATHVEC_FORTRAN_BUILTINS@
